```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Stepper as runtime.stepper
    participant Engine as CoreEngine
    participant Walkers as VoidWalkerRunner
    participant Scouts as Scouts (Heat, Ray, Memory, ...)
    participant Maps as CorticalMaps
    participant Connectome as SparseConnectome
    participant Plasticity as Neuroplasticity
    participant Events as ProprioceptionEvents
    
    Note over Stepper,Events: Hot Path: Single Simulation Tick (O(E) complexity)
    
    Stepper->>Engine: engine.step()
    
    Engine->>Walkers: run_void_walkers(connectome, maps, config)
    
    loop For each scout type
        Walkers->>Scouts: scout.run()
        
        Scouts->>Connectome: Get adjacency (neighbors)
        Connectome-->>Scouts: Edge list
        
        Scouts->>Scouts: Random walk / gradient ascent
        Scouts->>Scouts: Compute deposition values
        
        Scouts->>Maps: map.deposit(idx, value)
        Maps->>Maps: Update field[idx] += value
        
        Scouts->>Events: Emit VTTouchEvent(scout_id, idx, depth)
        Events->>Events: Append to event list
        
        Scouts-->>Walkers: Events emitted
    end
    
    Walkers-->>Engine: Aggregated events
    
    Engine->>Maps: Apply diffusion & decay
    Maps->>Maps: field *= decay_factor
    Maps->>Maps: field = convolve(field, diffusion_kernel)
    
    Engine->>Connectome: Get activation state
    Connectome-->>Engine: a (N-vector)
    
    Engine->>Plasticity: apply_gdsp(connectome, activation, events)
    Plasticity->>Plasticity: Compute Δw = η * gradient
    Plasticity->>Connectome: Update weights: w += Δw
    Plasticity->>Events: Emit DeltaWEvent(edge, Δw)
    
    Engine->>Connectome: Update activations
    Connectome->>Connectome: a' = activation_fn(neighbors, weights, bias)
    Connectome->>Events: Emit SpikeEvent(neuron_idx, activation)
    
    Engine->>Events: Emit BiasHintEvent (if B1 detector fired)
    
    Engine-->>Stepper: Observation dict {events, maps, activation}
    
    Stepper->>Stepper: Compute metrics (ZEMA, clustering, ...)
    Stepper->>Stepper: Apply B1 detector (bias signal processing)
    Stepper-->>Runtime: {observation, metrics}
    
    Note over Stepper,Events: Performance: ~10-100ms for N=1k, ~1-10s for N=100k (sparse)
```
